{"server":"tw","storyId":"act12d0_level_act12d0_03_end","groupId":"act12d0","stageId":"act12d0_03","title":"往昔","storyCode":"RI-3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"afab045af95396763f0972e8ef91c539978dd1df2cd11bb1b33d6f33df44e60c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"刻俄柏的精神狀態尚未恢復，大鬧一場後跑走，嘉維爾追尋無果後返回。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_temple_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這個怪胎好厲害！已經打退了好幾個人了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雖然聽不懂她在說什麼，但是好強啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"讓她來做大酋長感覺好像也不壞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘉維爾，你的同伴好厲害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然這種時候只會讓人傷腦筋就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"不過總算稍微消停了，我上去制住她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼，整合運動，你們又來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"原來是你們搶走了博士嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"別跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，這傻孩子要跑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我去追！特米米，你和博士不要亂動，我會回來找你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"誒，好的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，上面又有新的人打起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士，可不可以告訴我，嘉維爾在外面是什麼樣的？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"告訴她嘉維爾在羅德島的生活。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾在外面生活得很好嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"難道說你和嘉維爾也不是很熟嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！......啊，不，我只是以為你和嘉維爾一起回來的，嘉維爾好像很喜歡你的樣子，就以為你和嘉維爾關係很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係的，嘉維爾人很好的，你一定可以和她打好關係的！"}]},{"label":"告訴她嘉維爾當醫生的樣子。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，果然即使成為了醫生，嘉維爾始終是嘉維爾呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣啊，嘉維爾沒有變呀，太好了......"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"那如果嘉維爾要離開你的話，你會怎麼想？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"會很難過吧。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，果然呢，我當時也哭的很傷心呢......"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你怎麼可以這樣！嘉維爾那麼好，她要離開你你怎麼可以覺得無所謂！"}]},{"label":"祝賀她找到新的道路吧。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"你真厲害......我做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直希望嘉維爾能夠回來。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，那個，在嘉維爾的事情上，我、我是不會輸給你的！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"加油。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"（點頭）","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我也不會輸給你的！","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"所以那一次祭典的結果呢？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"那一次......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_temple_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼嘛，你們這幫大人也不過如此嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"還有誰要來挑戰我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"居然把這麼多大人給打倒了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，了不起啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"難道說嘉維爾真的能當上大酋長？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼啊，怎麼是你，祖瑪瑪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是造你的機器去了嗎？我去找你你都不理我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖瑪瑪","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"......我想最後試一試。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"試什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖瑪瑪","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"試試我的拳頭能不能打敗你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼說得好像要死了一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖瑪瑪","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"少廢話，今天我可不會輸給你，嘉維爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，那要打過才知道了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_temple_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"她們從中午一直打到了晚上都沒有分出勝負。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"到最後，她們兩個人都沒力氣了，被其他人給丟了下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是嘉維爾第一次參加祭典的情況了。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"祖瑪瑪是個什麼樣的人？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"祖瑪瑪是當時離得比較近的另一個部族的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"小時候，她和嘉維爾經常在一起打架，嘉維爾比她厲害，但祖瑪瑪也不是沒有贏過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我聽嘉維爾說，她有一天不知道怎麼的，就不再喜歡打架了，開始喜歡研究機器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得那天，是祖瑪瑪最後一次和嘉維爾打架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之後，祖瑪瑪就再也沒和嘉維爾打過，甚至很少出現在大家面前，再之後，她的部族就搬走了，我就再也沒見過她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"就連嘉維爾離開那次的大鬧祭典都沒有來。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，你沒事吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事。嘖，小刻這孩子真能跑，一下子就跑沒影了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"不過以她的能力應該不用擔心。特米米，祖瑪瑪來了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"還有誰要來挑戰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？看來我回來的正是時候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","aliases":["嘉維爾"]},{"speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","aliases":["刻俄柏"]},{"speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","aliases":["特米米"]},{"speakerId":"char_416_zumama","aliases":["？？？","祖瑪瑪"]}]}
